:: Script [script]
/*
	Global startup JavaScript. Same rule as the stylesheet: this file is
	for genuinely global setup (e.g. defining $config, seeding State
	variables). Area- or feature-specific JS should live next to the
	passages it supports, tagged [script], and SugarCube will concatenate
	it in automatically.
*/

/*
	This is also where later "fun with the web platform" experiments hook
	in — e.g. registering a Service Worker, wiring up the Web Audio API,
	or reading/writing extra localStorage keys alongside SugarCube's own
	save system.
*/
